  <History Date="01-09-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (very poor documentation.  21, 16 and 28 channel modes look completely different to the other modes. terminonlogy is all over the place.   the control contains tilt functions but there is no tilt.  these look like they are from a different fixture and don't make much sense)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="01-09-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="(Colour FX function descriptions seem to be misaligned in the charts and don't make sense.  made best guess)" Version="4" />
  <History Date="02-09-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's for 10, 21, 16 and 28 channel modes." Version="8" />
  <History Date="05-09-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised Atlabase ID's for 48, 58 and 73 channel modes (it seems there are two versions)" Version="9" />
  <History Date="05-02-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added multipart patch options for 58 channel mode." Version="10" />
